Under the unified tags proposal, all of TAG gets the same, flat grammar. This is akin to the removal of the internal grammar of PA, which was widely considered a Good Move. In this model, all tags may be converted with SE.

See https://mw.lojban.org/papri/internal_grammar_of_tags

